  "review": [
    "1:2 יָהּ — short liturgical divine name; swap for אֲדֹנָי if you prefer the full form.",
    "3:4 וּבַעַל יְשׁוּעָה — 'Owner of deliverance'; בַּעַל in construct is biblical but reads as 'Baal' to some ears.",
    "4:2 לִרְצוֹנְךָ נִכְנָעוֹת — feminine plural agreeing with the implied רוּחוֹת (winds), not with רוּחַ in 4:1."
  ]
